<template><section class="page"><PageHeader title="健康报告" eyebrow="个人数据总结" :back="true"/><div class="tabs"><button :class="{active:period==='7d'}" @click="period='7d';load()">近 7 天</button><button :class="{active:period==='30d'}" @click="period='30d';load()">近 30 天</button></div><div v-if="error" class="glass rounded-2xl p-4 text-sm text-[#ff3b30]">{{ error }}</div><div v-else-if="report" class="space-y-3"><div class="glass rounded-2xl p-4"><p class="muted text-sm">报告周期</p><p class="font-semibold mt-1">{{ report.from }} 至 {{ report.to }}</p></div><div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3"><div class="glass rounded-2xl p-4"><p class="muted text-xs">平均血糖</p><p class="text-2xl font-semibold mt-2">{{ report.glucose?.average }}<small class="text-xs font-normal muted"> mmol/L</small></p><p class="text-xs text-[#34c759] mt-1">范围内 {{ report.glucose?.timeInRange }}%</p></div><div class="glass rounded-2xl p-4"><p class="muted text-xs">用药依从性</p><p class="text-2xl font-semibold mt-2">{{ report.medication?.adherence }}<small class="text-xs font-normal muted">%</small></p><p class="text-xs muted mt-1">已服 {{ report.medication?.taken }} 次</p></div></div><div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3"><div class="glass rounded-2xl p-4"><p class="muted text-xs">饮食记录</p><p class="text-2xl font-semibold mt-2">{{ report.meals?.completed }}<small class="text-xs font-normal muted"> 次</small></p></div><div class="glass rounded-2xl p-4"><p class="muted text-xs">运动时长</p><p class="text-2xl font-semibold mt-2">{{ report.exercise?.minutes }}<small class="text-xs font-normal muted"> 分钟</small></p></div></div><div class="glass rounded-2xl p-4"><h2 class="font-semibold">本期亮点</h2><p v-for="item in (report.highlights || [])" :key="item" class="text-sm muted mt-3">{{ item }}</p></div></div><div v-else class="glass rounded-2xl p-6 text-center muted text-sm">正在生成报告…</div></section></template>
<script setup lang="ts">
import { onMounted, ref } from 'vue'; import PageHeader from '../components/PageHeader.vue'; import { apiClient } from '../services/api'
const period=ref('30d'); const report=ref<any>(null); const error=ref('')
async function load(){error.value='';try{report.value=await apiClient.report(period.value)}catch(e){error.value=e instanceof Error?e.message:'报告加载失败'}}
onMounted(load)
</script>
